#: ../../funding/ip-finance.rst:1
msgid "Shanghai IP-backed finance product directory"
msgstr "上海知识产权金融产品清单"

#: ../../funding/ip-finance.rst:4
msgid "Loan / insurance | Citywide / global"
msgstr "贷款与保险｜全市／全球"

#: ../../funding/ip-finance.rst:6
msgid "2026 directory published; lender review"
msgstr "2026清单已公布，须贷款方审核"

#: ../../funding/ip-finance.rst:8
msgid ""
"`Evidence S112 <https://sipa.sh.gov.cn/zscqjrfwpt/index.html>`_. "
"知识产权金融服务平台_上海市知识产权局."
msgstr "`证据 S112 <https://sipa.sh.gov.cn/zscqjrfwpt/index.html>`_. 知识产权金融服务平台_上海市知识产权局."

#: ../../funding/ip-finance.rst:10
msgid "Amount and mechanism"
msgstr "额度与机制"

#: ../../funding/ip-finance.rst:13
msgid "Bank and product-specific loan, insurance or trust terms"
msgstr "贷款、保险与信托条件依银行及产品确定"

#: ../../funding/ip-finance.rst:15
msgid "No equity; product obligations apply"
msgstr "不占股，适用产品义务"

#: ../../funding/ip-finance.rst:17
msgid "Eligibility and timing"
msgstr "资格与时间"

#: ../../funding/ip-finance.rst:20
msgid ""
"The 2026 IP bureau directory supplies borrower criteria, collateral, "
"rates, repayment, application steps and contacts by product. IP ownership "
"and bank assessment matter."
msgstr "2026年知识产权局清单逐项列出借款主体、担保、利率、还款、申请流程及联系方式，须核验知识产权及银行评估。"

#: ../../funding/ip-finance.rst:22
msgid "Product-specific"
msgstr "依具体产品"

#: ../../funding/ip-finance.rst:24
msgid "Contact and application"
msgstr "联系与申请"

#: ../../funding/ip-finance.rst:27
msgid ""
"`Official application / policy route "
"<https://sipa.sh.gov.cn/zscqjrfwpt/index.html>`_"
msgstr "`官方申请／政策入口 <https://sipa.sh.gov.cn/zscqjrfwpt/index.html>`_"

#: ../../funding/ip-finance.rst:29
msgid ""
"The linked authority or operator is the contact route. A direct current "
"program contact is not established in this profile."
msgstr "请通过所链主管部门或运营方联系，本档案未核实现任项目直接联系人。"

#: ../../funding/ip-finance.rst:31
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "编辑申请清单，实际流程以现行官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../funding/ip-finance.rst:33
msgid ""
"Select the current bank or public guarantee product and check borrower "
"eligibility."
msgstr "选择现行银行或公共担保产品，核验借款资格。"

#: ../../funding/ip-finance.rst:35
msgid ""
"Prepare accounts, cash-flow forecast, ownership and requested security "
"documents."
msgstr "准备报表、现金流预测、股权及要求的担保材料。"

#: ../../funding/ip-finance.rst:37
msgid ""
"Complete lender and guarantee assessment; compare all costs and repayment "
"terms."
msgstr "完成贷款及担保评估，比较全部成本与还款条件。"

#: ../../funding/ip-finance.rst:39
msgid ""
"Sign and track debt service; claim interest support only if independently "
"eligible."
msgstr "签约并管理偿债，贴息须另行符合资格。"

#: ../../funding/ip-finance.rst:41
msgid ""
"The published maximum is a ceiling, not an entitlement. Check the "
"applicable notice, eligible cost period, other public support and written "
"payment conditions."
msgstr "公布最高额为上限，不构成当然权益。须核验适用通知、合资格支出期间、其他财政资助及书面拨付条件。"
